sequenceDiagram
    actor User
    participant FE as Frontend
    participant API as API Server
    participant TMP as Temporal
    participant WKR as Worker
    participant LLM as LLM Provider
    participant DMN as Tools Daemon
    participant STR as Streaming Layer

    User->>FE: Send message
    FE->>API: gRPC request
    API->>TMP: Create workflow execution

    loop Agent Loop
        TMP->>WKR: Dispatch activity
        WKR->>LLM: Inference request\n(conversation + tools)
        LLM-->>WKR: Response with tool calls

        opt Tool Execution
            WKR->>DMN: Route tool request
            Note over DMN: Execute shell, file,\nMCP, or terminal op
            DMN-->>WKR: Tool result
        end

        WKR->>STR: Publish streaming updates
        STR-->>FE: Push live updates
        FE-->>User: Display response
    end

    Note over WKR,LLM: Loop continues until LLM\nreturns final response\nwith no tool calls
